---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
    <main style="background-color: #f5f5f4; color: #1c1917; min-height: 100vh;">
        <section style="padding: 120px 24px; text-align: center; background-color: #1c1917; color: white;">
            <span style="color: #f59e0b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.3em; font-size: 0.75rem;">The History</span>
            <h1 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 4rem; margin-top: 10px; font-style: italic;">Our Roots</h1>
        </section>

        <section style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 100px 24px; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; line-height: 1.8;">
            <h2 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 30px;">Honoring the Spartan Mill</h2>
            <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #44403c; margin-bottom: 25px;">
                Heirloom is located in the heart of Spartanburg, a city built on the grit and determination of the textile industry. Our building stands as a tribute to the men and women of the Spartan Mill.
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #44403c;">
                We believe in "Elevated Southern" cuisine—taking the humble ingredients of our ancestors and treating them with the respect they deserve. From our Walnut Grove Farms beef to our stone-ground Carolina grits, every plate tells a story of South Carolina's rich agricultural heritage.
            </p>
            
            <div style="margin-top: 60px; height: 400px; background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574096079513-d8259312b785?q=80&w=1974&auto=format&fit=crop'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"></div>
        </section>
    </main>
</Layout>